WEBVTT

00:09:28.693 --> 00:09:32.027
KA: Professor Hoking, 
javobingiz uchun rahmat.

00:09:32.027 --> 00:09:34.994
O'ylaymanki, biz buni 
hafta davomidagi boshqa konferensiya-

00:09:34.994 --> 00:09:38.120
-larimiz uchun qimmatli
ogohlantirish sifatida qabul qilamiz.

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:42.296
Professor, bugun bilimlaringizni 
biz bilan bo'lishish uchun ko'rsatgan

00:09:42.296 --> 00:09:45.258
ulkan sa'y-harakatingiz uchun 
chin dildan minnatdormiz.

00:09:45.258 --> 00:09:46.911
Sizga katta rahmat.

00:09:46.911 --> 00:09:50.741
(Qarsak)